                                        japicmp reports the deliberate deletion as CLASS_REMOVED.
                                        Drop this exclude once the japicmp baseline advances to the
                                        release that lands the removal.
                                    -->
                                    <exclude>com.demcha.compose.ConfigLoader</exclude>
